helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	pt	Neste exemplo, o prefixo é ContListener_. Assim, as seguintes sub-rotinas terão de ser implementadas no Basic:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	pt	ContListener_disposing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	pt	ContListener_elementInserted				20200411 15:09:53
