helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Vá para o primeiro registo da tabela.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
