helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	pt	0 (Zero)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	pt	Mostra zeros adicionais, caso o número contenha menos casas do que zeros no formato.				20200411 15:09:53
