helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3143225				0	pt	No \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>, uma data com o valor "0" corresponde a 30 de Dezembro de 1899.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	pt	Formatos de hora				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150108				0	pt	Para mostrar horas, minutos e segundos, utilize os seguintes códigos de formato numérico.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149158				0	pt	Formato				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154341				0	pt	Código de formatação				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154557				0	pt	Horas como 0-23				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156348				0	pt	h				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3143218				0	pt	Horas como 00-23				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155266				0	pt	hh				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150139				0	pt	Minutos como 0-59				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149588				0	pt	m				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150531				0	pt	Minutos como 00-59				20200411 15:09:53
