helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155377				0	pt	Sem função				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	pt	Não será executada qualquer função.				20200411 15:09:53
