helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152883				0	pt	BETWEEN 10 AND 20				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159406				0	pt	devolve nomes de campos com conteúdo de campo com valores entre 10 e 20 (os campos podem ser campos de texto ou campos numéricos).				20200411 15:09:53
