helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	par_id1006200801024957				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Insira o valor onde a linha do eixo deve cruzar o outro eixo.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
