helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153573				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_QUANTILSRANG\"\>Devolve a ordem percentual de um valor numa amostra.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
