helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	pt	Devolve \<emph\>Número\</emph\>            \<emph\>!!\</emph\>, o factorial duplo de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, no qual \<emph\>Número\</emph\> corresponde a um número inteiro maior ou igual a zero.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2480849				0	pt	Para números pares FACTDUPLO(n) devolve:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	pt	2*4*6*8* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2927335				0	pt	Para números ímpares FACTDUPLO(n) devolve:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	pt	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	pt	FACTDUPLO(0) devolve 1 por definição.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154622				0	pt	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
