helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145163				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCCOS\"\>Devolve o co-seno trigonométrico inverso de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153565				0	pt	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150020				0	pt	ACOS(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159134				0	pt	 Esta função devolve o co-seno trigonométrico inverso de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, que corresponde ao ângulo (em radianos) cujo co-seno é Número. O ângulo devolvido encontra-se entre 0 e PI.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id679647				0	pt	Para devolver o ângulo em graus, utilize a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149882				0	pt	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150128				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOS(-1)\</item\> devolve 3,14159265358979 (radianos PI)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8792382				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ACOS(0,5))\</item\> devolve 60. O co-seno de 60 graus é 0,5.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145355				0	pt	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOSH\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145355				0	pt	ACOSH				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157993				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCOSHYP\"\>Devolve o co-seno hiperbólico inverso de um número.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145295				0	pt	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151017				0	pt	ACOSH(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149000	64			0	pt	 Esta função devolve o co-seno hiperbólico inverso de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, que corresponde ao número cujo co-seno hiperbólico é Número. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6393932				0	pt	 Número tem de ser maior ou igual a 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150566				0	pt	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145629				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOSH(1)\</item\> devolve 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id951567				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOSH(COSH(4))\</item\> devolve 4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149027				0	pt	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOT\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149027				0	pt	ACOT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155818				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCCOT\"\>Devolve a cotangente inversa (o arco co-tangente) do número indicado.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153225				0	pt	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158419				0	pt	ACOT(Número)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	pt	 Esta função devolve a cotangente trigonométrica inversa de \<emph\>Número\</emph\>, que corresponde ao ângulo (em radianos) cuja co-tangente é Número. O ângulo devolvido encontra-se entre 0 e PI.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5834528				0	pt	Para devolver o ângulo em graus, utilize a função GRAUS.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147538				0	pt	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155375				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOT(1)\</item\> devolve 0,785398163397448 (radianos PI/4).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8589434				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GRAUS(ACOT(1))\</item\> devolve 45. A tangente de 45 graus é 1. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148426				0	pt	\<bookmark_value\>função ACOTH\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
