helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150608				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOTH(1,1)\</item\> devolve a co-tangente hiperbólica inversa de 1,1, aproximadamente 1,52226.				20200411 15:09:53
