helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id4685201				0	pt	Para criar texto que não quer imprimir, proceda do seguinte modo:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149789				0	pt	Escolha \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Inserir - Moldura\</item\> e clique em \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Aceitar\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	pt	Insira texto na moldura e, se quiser, redimensione-a.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150242				0	pt	Escolha \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatar - Moldura/Objecto\</item\> e clique no separador \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Opções\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145227				0	pt	Na área \<emph\>Propriedades\</emph\>, desmarque a caixa \<emph\>Imprimir\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150320				0	pt	Clique em \<emph\>Aceitar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3138828				0	pt	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text.xhp\" name=\"Ocultar texto\"\>Ocultar texto\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
