helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155122				0	pt	À página				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155144				0	pt	Ancora o item seleccionado à página actual.				20200411 15:09:53
