helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	pt	Na lista \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categorias\</item\>, seleccione "Modelos" e clique em \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Aceitar\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
