helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	pt	Clique no separador \<emph\>Substituir\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145620				0	pt	Na lista \<emph\>Correcção automática\</emph\>, seleccione o par de palavras que quer remover.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145645				0	pt	Clique em \<emph\>Eliminar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
