helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145763				0	pt	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_ENV_PRT:BTN_TOP\"\>Insere o envelope no tabuleiro da impressora com o lado a imprimir virado para cima.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
